{"nodes": [{"id": "skill_defining_users", "label": "Skill: defining-users (section 9, tasks 9.1-9.2)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/defining-users/SKILL.md", "source_location": "L1-98", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "defining_users_skill_curriculum_section_9", "label": "\u0627\u0644\u0642\u0633\u0645 9 \u2014 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0633\u062a\u062e\u062f\u0645\u0648\u0646 \u0648\u0623\u0635\u062d\u0627\u0628 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0635\u0644\u062d\u0629", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/defining-users/SKILL.md", "source_location": "L10", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "skill_task_9_1_roles", "label": "Task 9.1 - user roles and their needs", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/defining-users/SKILL.md", "source_location": "L18-58", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "skill_task_9_2_stakeholders", "label": "Task 9.2 - other stakeholders: external services, affected parties, the system itself", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/defining-users/SKILL.md", "source_location": "L61-87", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "skill_default_single_user_entity_with_role", "label": "Default technical decision: one User entity + a role field", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/defining-users/SKILL.md", "source_location": "L33-41", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Explain in one plain sentence with no jargon; do not discuss tables, keys or relations with the trainee - redirect to section 13 if asked. Separate entities only when the stored data differs fundamentally, which is rare at this level."}, {"id": "skill_question_role_overlap", "label": "Mandatory question: can one person hold two roles, and what must he never do to himself", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/defining-users/SKILL.md", "source_location": "L43-51", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "In the real build this question was never asked, so a service provider could book his own appointments; only discovered during build and then needed blocking in both UI and server."}, {"id": "skill_concept_needs_not_features", "label": "Rule: rewrite a need stated as a feature back into a need", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/defining-users/SKILL.md", "source_location": "L29-31", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A need survives a design change; a screen does not. A feature ('inventory management') is sized at a journey and also survives."}, {"id": "defining_users_skill_dont_ask_trainee_to_classify", "label": "\u0644\u0627 \u062a\u064f\u062d\u0645\u0651\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062a\u062f\u0631\u0651\u0628 \u0627\u062e\u062a\u064a\u0627\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u064a\u0627\u0646\u0627\u062a \u0623\u0648 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0641\u0627\u062a\u064a\u062d \u2014 \u0642\u0631\u0627\u0631\u0627\u062a \u062a\u0642\u0646\u064a\u0629 \u0642\u0631\u0627\u0631\u0643 \u0623\u0646\u062a", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/defining-users/SKILL.md", "source_location": "L14", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "defining_users_skill_ask_in_plain_language", "label": "\u0627\u0633\u0623\u0644 \u0628\u0644\u063a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0648\u0627\u0642\u0639 \u0644\u0627 \u0628\u0633\u0624\u0627\u0644 \u0645\u062c\u0631\u0651\u062f: \u0645\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0634\u062e\u0627\u0635 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062e\u062a\u0644\u0641\u0648\u0646\u061f \u0647\u0644 \u064a\u0631\u0648\u064